  "contentHtml": "<p>주사위&#160;놀이&#160;학습&#160;게임&#160;-&#160;&#160;중학교&#160;과학&#160;1,2,3&#160;학년&#160;용어&#160;모음</p><p>중학교 과학 학년별로 전체단원에 나오는 용어들로 문제를 만들어 두었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">사용된 과학용어는 재과만에&#160; 전영혜(하남중) 선생님이 올려주신 과학용어 활용했습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/2198\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/2198</a></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학기말에 복습용으로 활용하면 좋습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1학년 과학 용어 모음 - 전체단원 (122문제)</p><p><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame1.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame1.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c93573e9b044d30c28fdf31423fc2f36d60c637\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c93573e9b044d30c28fdf31423fc2f36d60c637\" data-origin-width=\"1108\" data-origin-height=\"585\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2학년 과학 용어 모음 - 전체단원 (169문제)</p><p><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame2.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame2.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5146756e97a7e359ede6512cac10d9be00984d84\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5146756e97a7e359ede6512cac10d9be00984d84\" data-origin-width=\"1110\" data-origin-height=\"584\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>3학년 과학 용어 모음 - 전체단원 (138문제)</p><p><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame3.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame3.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85ddc7180ccaec5b8b4e1d7673945cc808eb3748\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85ddc7180ccaec5b8b4e1d7673945cc808eb3748\" data-origin-width=\"1106\" data-origin-height=\"588\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>직접 자신만의 문제로 만들고 싶으면 아래 링크 참고</p><p><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2732\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/2732</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"주사위 놀이 학습 게임(브루마블 게임) 만들기(온라인, 태블릿용)\" data-og-description=\"주사위 놀이 학습게임 일단 아래 링크에 접속해서 학생 입장에서 참여해 보자. 넌센스 퀴즈로 만든 주사위 놀이 학습게임이다. (수업시간에 학생들에게 보내주고 사용해도 된다) https://sciencej1.ca\" data-og-host=\"sciencelove.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2732\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2732\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/u8PAQ/hyUL31nVlK/k3d8ZoWqf0mcPQOZOij3u0/img.png?width=800&amp;height=424&amp;face=257_153_298_199,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bHuNi1/hyULWgQnoi/CQXNyKkZ2kij0JxljgWfV1/img.png?width=800&amp;height=424&amp;face=257_153_298_199,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/k8WVG/hyUL0Q6Foc/r2OpOoyiUhOWBzMkahZYG0/img.png?width=1732&amp;height=920&amp;face=0_0_1732_920\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2732\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2732\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/u8PAQ/hyUL31nVlK/k3d8ZoWqf0mcPQOZOij3u0/img.png?width=800&amp;height=424&amp;face=257_153_298_199,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bHuNi1/hyULWgQnoi/CQXNyKkZ2kij0JxljgWfV1/img.png?width=800&amp;height=424&amp;face=257_153_298_199,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/k8WVG/hyUL0Q6Foc/r2OpOoyiUhOWBzMkahZYG0/img.png?width=1732&amp;height=920&amp;face=0_0_1732_920\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">주사위 놀이 학습 게임(브루마블 게임) 만들기(온라인, 태블릿용)</p><p class=\"og-desc\">주사위 놀이 학습게임 일단 아래 링크에 접속해서 학생 입장에서 참여해 보자. 넌센스 퀴즈로 만든 주사위 놀이 학습게임이다. (수업시간에 학생들에게 보내주고 사용해도 된다) https://sciencej1.ca</p><p class=\"og-host\">sciencelove.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
